        <briefdescription>
<para>Validate a planner decision against approximation boundaries. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Maps each <ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1evaluation_1aa4a7e1978a67c73fd81caf85fc824adc" kindref="member">ExecutionPath</ref> to its implied layer(s) and applies <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1evaluation_1_1_default_approximation_rule_engine_1a104c7407fac52dfa8f09231dd60bd8f5" kindref="member">checkBoundary()</ref></computeroutput> for each. Returns the most restrictive result.</para>
<para>Path → layer(s) mapping:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>AnnOnly → {Ann}</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AnnTensorSummary → {Ann, TensorSummary}</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>AnnTensorExactGraph → {Ann, TensorSummary, ExactGraph}</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>DirectExactGraph → {ExactGraph}</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>DistributedSummaryFirstExactOnDemand → {DistributedShard, ExactGraph}</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>decision</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The planner decision to validate. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>policy</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Active governance policy. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="structthemis_1_1evaluation_1_1_boundary_check_result" kindref="compound">BoundaryCheckResult</ref> representing the overall compliance. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
